	(text "the mixer that I created was just a mixer, not useful for this part. For the sequencer we need \na dupong 6 pin input that will be connected to the sequencer board 6 duponts. This other board \nwill be half hexagon i guess and it has to contain the 6 potentiometers. \n\nPotentially could be even another hexagon since we saw that it fits to have 6 hexagones there\nand it has as output directly the CV at the center (so it means that we need to bring supply and \nthe TL072 to have the buffer. Or we could use the \"active\" mixer"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.56 83.058 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "6b950a95-61e2-411d-beb6-2de054376c00")
	)
